From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tonrakun <tonrakun@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:01:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Kodama: expire prefetch and unload delay tickets without a
 lifespan

License: GPL-3.0

ChunkHolderManager counts down the remaining ticks of every ticket that has a
lifespan, in every tick. The unload delay and prefetch tickets (up to 1024
chunks per world, 20-30 seconds each) made that loop 8% of the main thread
with 20 mixed bots, against 3% in Paper. The tickets now have no lifespan and
KodamaChunkTickets removes them from its own expiry maps once per second.

